---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="General Contracting in Temple, TX | Bar Moon Contracting">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="pt-20 bg-light-neutral text-primary">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/services" class="text-sm text-accent hover:underline">← Back to Services</a>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">General Contracting in Temple, TX &amp; Bell County</h1>
      <img src="/images/texas house.jpg" alt="Modern Texas ranch home with limestone and metal roof in Central Texas" class="w-full aspect-[16/9] object-cover object-[50%_70%] rounded-xl mb-6" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" />
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-10">Your trusted single point of contact for repairs, renovations, painting, roofing, additions, and custom projects. We coordinate everything so you don’t have to.</p>

      <div class="prose max-w-none text-gray-700 mb-16 space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">What We Handle</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>General repairs and maintenance for homes and small commercial</li>
          <li>Painting, roofing, and finish work</li>
          <li>Storm damage restoration and insurance claims</li>
          <li>Additions, structural work, and major remodels</li>
          <li>Coordination of specialty trades (electrical, plumbing, HVAC)</li>
          <li>Commercial, church, and facility projects</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Local Considerations</h2>
        <p>We know the realities of building in Bell County—expansive clay soils, intense heat, sudden storms, and older housing stock. Our estimates account for these conditions from day one. We use materials and methods proven in Central Texas.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Our Process</h2>

        <div class="space-y-10">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
            <img src="/images/initial-meeting.jpg" alt="Free Consultation" class="w-full h-64 md:h-80 object-cover object-[50%_65%] rounded-xl md:col-span-1" />
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="bg-accent text-dark-blue font-bold w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm flex-shrink-0">1</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Free Consultation</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Stage 1: Understanding Your Needs</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>We sit down with you—over coffee if you’re local—to understand the problem, your goals, and your budget. No pressure, just honest conversation.</p>
              <p>Whether it’s a leaky faucet, a kitchen remodel, or a custom build, every project starts the same way: listening. We’ll assess the scope and give you a clear picture of what’s involved.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
            <img src="/images/planning-and-drafting.jpg" alt="Assessment &amp; Planning" class="w-full h-64 md:h-80 object-cover object-center rounded-xl md:col-span-1" />
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="bg-accent text-dark-blue font-bold w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm flex-shrink-0">2</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Assessment &amp; Planning</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Stage 2: Evaluating the Work &amp; Creating a Plan</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>We inspect the site, measure twice, and develop a detailed plan tailored to your project—big or small.</p>
              <p>For repairs, that means diagnosing the root cause. For renovations and builds, it means design options, material selections, and permits. We know Central Texas conditions inside out—clay soils, heat, drainage—and plan accordingly.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
            <img src="/images/foundation.jpg" alt="Transparent Proposal" class="w-full h-64 md:h-80 object-cover object-center rounded-xl md:col-span-1" />
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="bg-accent text-dark-blue font-bold w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm flex-shrink-0">3</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Transparent Proposal</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Stage 3: Clear Pricing with No Surprises</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>You get a written proposal with a clear scope, honest pricing, and a clear, realistic timeline—before any work begins.</p>
              <p>We don’t believe in hidden fees or vague estimates. You’ll know exactly what you’re paying for, when the work starts, and when it’ll be done.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
            <img src="/images/framing.jpg" alt="Skilled Execution" class="w-full h-64 md:h-80 object-cover object-[50%_20%] rounded-xl md:col-span-1" />
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="bg-accent text-dark-blue font-bold w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm flex-shrink-0">4</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Skilled Execution</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Stage 4: Quality Work, Start to Finish</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>Our experienced team gets to work—with proper tools, quality materials, and the craftsmanship Central Texas has trusted for five generations.</p>
              <p>From a single repair to a full renovation or custom build, every task is handled with precision. We keep a clean job site, communicate daily, and never cut corners.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 5 -->
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
            <img src="/images/interior.jpg" alt="Quality Check &amp; Walkthrough" class="w-full h-64 md:h-80 object-cover object-center rounded-xl md:col-span-1" />
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="bg-accent text-dark-blue font-bold w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm flex-shrink-0">5</span>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Quality Check &amp; Walkthrough</h3>
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Stage 5: Making Sure It’s Right</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p>Before we call it done, we inspect every detail. Then we walk through it with you—because it’s not finished until you’re satisfied.</p>
              <p>We hold ourselves to a high standard. If something isn’t perfect, we fix it. Our goal is work you’ll be proud of for years to come.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p><strong>How long does a typical project take?</strong> Small repairs: 1–5 days. Larger remodels or additions: 2–6 weeks. We provide clear, realistic timelines upfront.</p>
        <p><strong>Do you handle insurance work?</strong> Yes. We work directly with adjusters and ensure proper documentation.</p>
        <p><strong>Do you pull permits?</strong> Yes, we handle all permitting and inspections for compliant work.</p>
        <p><strong>What if my project changes mid-way?</strong> We document changes in writing and adjust the scope and timeline accordingly.</p>
        <p><strong>How do you ensure quality across trades?</strong> We use trusted local partners and supervise all work on site.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-deep-blue text-white p-8 rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Need a general contractor you can trust?</h3>
        <a href="/get-quote" class="inline-block bg-accent hover:bg-gold text-dark-blue font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Call or text: <a href="tel:2545813808" class="text-gold-primary">(254) 581-3808</a> • Mon–Fri 8:00 AM – 6:00 PM</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Structured Data for this service page -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@graph": [
        {
          "@type": "Service",
          "serviceType": "General Contracting",
          "name": "General Contracting in Temple, TX & Bell County",
          "description": "Trusted general contracting for repairs, renovations including painting and roofing, additions, storm damage, and full project management.",
          "provider": { "@type": "LocalBusiness", "name": "Bar Moon Contracting", "url": "https://barmooncontracting.com" },
          "areaServed": ["Temple, TX", "Belton, TX", "Killeen, TX", "Bell County, TX"],
          "url": "https://barmooncontracting.com/services/general-contracting-temple-tx"
        },
        {
          "@type": "FAQPage",
          "mainEntity": [
            { "@type": "Question", "name": "How long does a typical project take?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Small repairs: 1–5 days. Larger remodels or additions: 2–6 weeks. We provide clear, realistic timelines upfront." } },
            { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you handle insurance work?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. We work directly with adjusters and ensure proper documentation." } },
            { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you pull permits?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, we handle all permitting and inspections for compliant work." } },
            { "@type": "Question", "name": "What if my project changes mid-way?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We document changes in writing and adjust the scope and timeline accordingly." } },
            { "@type": "Question", "name": "How do you ensure quality across trades?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We use trusted local partners and supervise all work on site." } }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>